subckt Main (VDD VSS Vout Vin2 Vinp Vinm S1 S2 S3 S4)
subckt ideal_switch (p n cp cn)
parameters ron=1 roff=1e12 vt=0.5
core (p n) bsource i=v(p,n)/(v(cp,cn)>vt ? ron : roff)
ends ideal_switch
C1 (net1 net2) capacitor c=1p
M1 (Vin2 Vinp net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (Vout Vinm net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (Vin2 Vinp net0 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (Vout Vinm net0 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
S1 (net1 net0 S1 VSS) ideal_switch
S2 (net1 VDD S2 VSS) ideal_switch
S3 (net2 net3 S3 VSS) ideal_switch
S4 (net2 VSS S4 VSS) ideal_switch
